        <description>Conversion to currency of difference between &quot;SUM Destination Amount&quot;, &quot;SUM Buy Origin Amount&quot;, &quot;Total Services Std Buy Amount&quot; and &quot;Total Taxes&quot;</description>
        <externalId>false</externalId>
        <formula>SUM_Destination_Amount__c - SUM_Buy_Origin_Amount_number__c - Total_Services_Std_Buy_Amount_number__c -  Total_Taxes__c</formula>
